<view class="container game-page">
  <view class="topline">
    <text class="game-kicker">思维闯关 · 11</text>
    <text class="title-badge">4×4</text>
  </view>
  <view class="title-row">
    <text class="game-title">迷你数独</text>
    <text class="title-badge">逻辑突围</text>
  </view>
  <view class="game-lead">每行、每列、每个 2×2 宫都填 1–4，不能重复。点空格，再点数字。</view>

  <view class="status-line">
    <text class="status-strong">已填 {{filled}}/16</text>
    <text class="mono">{{wrong ? '有一格不对' : '排除法'}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="board">
    <view class="cell {{item.given ? 'given' : ''}} {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}} {{item.wrong ? 'wrong' : ''}} {{item.hint ? 'hint' : ''}}" wx:for="{{cells}}" wx:key="index" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="tapCell" hover-class="press">{{item.value || ''}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="numpad">
    <view class="num" wx:for="{{numbers}}" wx:key="*this" data-n="{{item}}" bindtap="place" hover-class="press">{{item}}</view>
    <view class="num clear" bindtap="clearCell" hover-class="press">清空当前格</view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions-row">
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="showHint">提示一格</view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="reset">重来</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="newGame">新题</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="hint-box">{{hint}}</view>

  <view class="rule-box">
    <view class="rule-title">能学到什么 · 约束满足与排除</view>
    <view class="rule-text">数独不是猜，是排除：一行有了 1，其他格就不能是 1；一列、一个 2×2 宫同理。</view>
  </view>
</view>
